er-attachments/assets/1d42204d-7832-4a59-8153-6b7ec52c45b7\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de0f3f70-a5f3-4dcb-9a07-a698d314b052\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a4a7de12-ff6e-48bd-bcdb-24cf6c641e02\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d95ad8e1-774e-46c8-b0d5-caa8611c87bb\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b52acdc0-6dff-401b-a51e-2a08810402b7\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a23751a5-99e7-4905-9a6a-f21496d86345\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33da7604-2fe2-4f79-943b-5d2f758c7c03\" />\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7291852-4b3c-47d1-a5b4-679ae8af88f1\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Open the Godot 4.7 Editor on Android.\n2. Open the TileMap and TileSet editor panels.\n3. Try to drag or scroll to navigate the grid.\n4. Notice the entire interface glitches and disappears, turning into a blank screen.\n5. Pinching to zoom in or zoom out does absolutely nothing to bring the UI back; it remains a completely blank screen\n6. No matter how much you try to move right or left, it's useless.\n7. I suggest adding a drag bar to drag the tilemap up, down, left, and right.  \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A (Screenshots attached)","closed_by":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/foll